#: ../../linux/sysstat/pidstat.rst:2
msgid "pidstat - 报告Linux任务（进程）的统计信息：I/O，CPU，内存等"
msgstr "pidstat - Report Statistics for Linux Tasks (Processes): I/O, CPU, Memory, and More"

#: ../../linux/sysstat/pidstat.rst:4
msgid "用于监控进程和线程"
msgstr "Used to monitor processes and threads"

#: ../../linux/sysstat/pidstat.rst:7
msgid "语法"
msgstr "Syntax"

#: ../../linux/sysstat/pidstat.rst:9
msgid "``pidstat <OPTIONS> [INTERVAL] [COUNT]``"
msgstr "``pidstat <OPTIONS> [INTERVAL] [COUNT]``"

#: ../../linux/sysstat/pidstat.rst:11
msgid "-p ALL 显示所有活动和不活动的进程"
msgstr "-p ALL show all active and inactive processes"

#: ../../linux/sysstat/pidstat.rst:13
msgid "-d I/O的统计数据"
msgstr "-d I/O statistics"

#: ../../linux/sysstat/pidstat.rst:15
msgid "-r 内存使用情况的数据"
msgstr "-r memory usage statistics"

#: ../../linux/sysstat/pidstat.rst:18
msgid "示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../linux/sysstat/pidstat.rst:28
msgid "PID - 被监控的任务的进程号"
msgstr "PID - the process ID of the monitored task"

#: ../../linux/sysstat/pidstat.rst:29
#, python-format
msgid "%usr - 当在用户层执行(应用程序)时这个任务的cpu使用率，和 nice 优先级无关。注意这个字段计算的cpu时间不包括在虚拟处理器中花去的时间。"
msgstr "%usr - this task's CPU usage when executing at the user level (applications), regardless of nice priority. Note that the CPU time counted in this field does not include time spent in a virtual processor."

#: ../../linux/sysstat/pidstat.rst:31
#, python-format
msgid "%system - 这个任务在系统层使用时的cpu使用率。"
msgstr "%system - this task's CPU usage when running at the system level."

#: ../../linux/sysstat/pidstat.rst:32
#, python-format
msgid "%guest - 任务花费在虚拟机上的cpu使用率（运行在虚拟处理器）。"
msgstr "%guest - CPU usage the task spent on a virtual machine (running in a virtual processor)."

#: ../../linux/sysstat/pidstat.rst:33
msgid "%CPU - 任务总的cpu使用率。在SMP环境(多处理器)中，如果在命令行中输入-I参数的话，cpu使用率会除以你的cpu数量。"
msgstr "%CPU - the task's total CPU usage. In an SMP environment (multiple processors), if the -I option is given on the command line, CPU usage is divided by your number of CPUs."

#: ../../linux/sysstat/pidstat.rst:34
msgid "CPU - 正在运行这个任务的处理器编号。"
msgstr "CPU - the number of the processor currently running this task."

#: ../../linux/sysstat/pidstat.rst:35
msgid "Command - 这个任务的命令名称。"
msgstr "Command - the name of this task's command."

